 "remarks": "64 Sanford Lane is a much beloved treasure that has been meticulously redesigned for comfort, elbow room and maintaining character. This enchanting home is located in the popular neighborhood of Pepper Ridge specifically known as Case Acre Estates. Highly coveted for both its charm and convenience, you can be at the train in 10 minutes, either highway in less than 10 or your favorite coffee shop in 120 seconds. (If you choose to walk to get your morning beverage make it 10 minutes. Either way it will still be hot by the time you reach your front porch.) Completely renovated in 2024 by discerning owners no detail has been overlooked from the walk-in pantry off the kitchen to the cozy reading nook in the upstairs hallway. Wide plank floors evoke the feeling of a bygone era while modern fixtures and appliances allow for ease of today's living. You'll love entertaining in the room-to-roam kitchen or formal dining room with fireplace. The large deck lends itself to pleasurable outdoor three season gatherings. And overnight guests will appreciate the privacy and beauty of their first floor quarters. Use the finished space in the lower level as a home gym, yoga room, gamer haven or all three! There is no shortage of square footage or possibilities in this timeless special property. Walk to schools, bus line or houses of worship.",
